0" height="800" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="sync" class="progressive-img" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> </article> <div class="feed-ad-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="ad-container  " data-astro-cid-rhiki3z3> <ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display:block; min-height: 256px; width: 100%;" data-ad-client="ca-pub-7715786646668436" data-ad-slot="3902922885" data-ad-format="fluid" data-full-width-responsive="true" data-ad-layout-key="-fb+5w+4e-db+86" data-astro-cid-rhiki3z3></ins> </div> </div> <article class="post-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="post-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>13.</div> <h2 class="post-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/kopalnia-magazine-2-world-cup-2026-ania-wielunska-design" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> Kopalnia Magazine 2 World Cup 2026 Ania Wielunska Design </a> </h2> <a href="/kopalnia-magazine-2-world-cup-2026-ania-wielunska-design" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fstyles%2Fmedium%2Fpublic%2Foriginals%2Fhero_kopalnia-magazine-2-world-cup-2026-ania-wieluska.jpg" data-large-src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Foriginals%2Fhero_kopalnia-magazine-2-world-cup-2026-ania-wieluska.jpg" alt="Kopalnia Magazine 2 World Cup 2026 Ania Wielunska Design" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="sync" class="progressive-img" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> </article>  <article class="post-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="post-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>14.</div> <h2 class="post-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/inkdrum-browser-risograph-print-simulator-inkdrum-team" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> INKDRUM Browser Risograph Print Simulator by INKDRUM Team </a> </h2> <a href="/inkdrum-browser-risograph-print-simulator-inkdrum-team" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fstyles%2Fmedium%2Fpublic%2Foriginals%2Finkdrum_0.jpg" data-large-src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Foriginals%2Finkdrum_0.jpg" alt="INKDRUM Browser Risograph Print Simulator by INKDRUM Team" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="sync" class="progressive-img" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> </article>  <article class="post-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="post-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>15.</div> <h2 class="post-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/bar-popolare-visual-identity-branding-leonardo-maltese" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> Bar Popolare Visual Identity Branding by Leonardo Maltese </a> </h2> <a href="/bar-popolare-visual-identity-branding-leonardo-maltese" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fstyles%2Fmedium%2Fpublic%2Foriginals%2Fbar-popolare_0_0.jpg" data-large-src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Foriginals%2Fbar-popolare_0_0.jpg" alt="Bar Popolare Visual Identity Branding by Leonardo Maltese" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="sync" class="progressive-img" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> </article>  <article class="post-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="post-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>16.</div> <h2 class="post-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/imogen-oke-visual-identity-branding-thought-found" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> Imogen Oke Visual Identity Branding by Thought &amp; Found </a> </h2> <a href="/imogen-oke-visual-identity-branding-thought-found" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fstyles%2Fmedium%2Fpublic%2Foriginals%2Fimogen-oke_0_0.jpg" data-large-src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Foriginals%2Fimogen-oke_0_0.jpg" alt="Imogen Oke Visual Identity Branding by Thought &#38; Found" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="sync" class="progressive-img" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> </article>  <article class="post-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="post-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>17.</div> <h2 class="post-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/drawink-animals-illustrations-getillustrations-line-art" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> Drawink Animals Illustrations Getillustrations: Line Art </a> </h2> <a href="/drawink-animals-illustrations-getillustrations-line-art" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fstyles%2Fmedium%2Fpublic%2Foriginals%2Fhero_drawink-animals-illustrations-getillustrations.jpg" data-large-src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Foriginals%2Fhero_drawink-animals-illustrations-getillustrations.jpg" alt="Drawink Animals Illustrations Getillustrations: Line Art" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="auto" decoding="sync" class="progressive-img" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </a> </article>  <article class="post-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="post-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>18.</div> <h2 class="post-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/diesta-streamlining-insurance-payments-significaco-ui" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> diesta streamlining insurance payments significa.co UI </a> </h2> <a href="/diesta-streamlining-insurance-payments-significaco-ui" data-astro-prefetch data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fstyles%2Fmedium%2Fpublic%2Foriginals%2Fhero_diesta-streamlining-insurance-payments-significaco.jpg" data-large-src="/api/img?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcms.abduzeedo.com%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Foriginals%2Fher